{"id": "D001", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "The mileage rate is 25p per mile after the first 10,000 business miles in a tax year.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["HR-201:v4.0:s4:c1"], "cited_text": {"HR-201:v4.0:s4:c1": "Staff who use their own car for business journeys can claim 45p per mile for the first 10,000 business miles in a tax year and 25p per mile after that. Your normal commute between home and your usual workplace cannot be claimed. Record the start and end point and the purpose of each journey."}, "cited_by_model": ["HR-201:v4.0:s4:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "HR-201:v4.0:s4:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.03278688524590164, "sections": ["HR-201#4"]}, {"id": "HR-202:v2.0:s1:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.031754032258064516, "sections": ["HR-202#1"]}, {"id": "HR-202:v2.0:s4:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.03149801587301587, "sections": ["HR-202#4"]}, {"id": "HR-203:v1.3:s5:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.03076923076923077, "sections": ["HR-203#5"]}, {"id": "SEC-302:v3.1:s3:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.02964254577157803, "sections": ["SEC-302#3"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 930, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 60, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 17, "cost_usd": 0.00012334, "retrieval_ms": 335.19129999967845, "generation_ms": 2187.4477999999726, "total_ms": 2522.639099999651, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_e2c2e45329d24c7baa50aedbaa3818a3", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D002", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "A new supplier must provide public liability insurance of at least £5 million; if it employs staff, it must also provide employer’s liability insurance. The handbook does not specify a minimum cover amount for employer’s liability. This procedure applies before placing a first order with a new supplier.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["SUP-501:v1.0:s2:c1", "SUP-501:v1.0:s1:c1"], "cited_text": {"SUP-501:v1.0:s2:c1": "New suppliers must provide proof of public liability insurance of at least £5 million and, where they employ staff, employer's liability insurance. Suppliers that will process personal data on Fernhollow's behalf must also complete the data protection questionnaire, which Information Security reviews.", "SUP-501:v1.0:s1:c1": "Follow this procedure before placing a first order with any new supplier of goods or services, including hauliers and subcontractors."}, "cited_by_model": ["SUP-501:v1.0:s2:c1", "SUP-501:v1.0:s1:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "SUP-501:v1.0:s2:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.03278688524590164, "sections": ["SUP-501#2"]}, {"id": "SUP-501:v1.0:s1:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.03200204813108039, "sections": ["SUP-501#1"]}, {"id": "FAC-401:v2.0:s2:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.029513888888888888, "sections": ["FAC-401#2"]}, {"id": "SUP-501:v1.0:s3:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.029206349206349208, "sections": ["SUP-501#3"]}, {"id": "OPS-105:v1.1:s2:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.028594771241830064, "sections": ["OPS-105#2"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 899, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 253, "reasoning_tokens": 146, "embedding_tokens": 14, "cost_usd": 0.00021668, "retrieval_ms": 291.10300000047573, "generation_ms": 3193.563300000278, "total_ms": 3484.666300000754, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_cef1fc30d1e34c14ac614ba0f4bf29a2", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D003", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "At Calder Wharf depot, the fire assembly point is the grass area beside the visitor car park.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["FAC-402:v1.5:s3:c1"], "cited_text": {"FAC-402:v1.5:s3:c1": "Go to the assembly point shown on the site plan by each exit. At Ashby Park depot this is the staff car park by the main gate. At Calder Wharf depot it is the grass area beside the visitor car park."}, "cited_by_model": ["FAC-402:v1.5:s3:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "FAC-402:v1.5:s3:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.03278688524590164, "sections": ["FAC-402#3"]}, {"id": "FAC-402:v1.5:s4:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.03225806451612903, "sections": ["FAC-402#4"]}, {"id": "FAC-402:v1.5:s5:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.03149801587301587, "sections": ["FAC-402#5"]}, {"id": "FAC-402:v1.5:s1:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.03057889822595705, "sections": ["FAC-402#1"]}, {"id": "FAC-402:v1.5:s2:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.03055037313432836, "sections": ["FAC-402#2"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 921, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 56, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 12, "cost_usd": 0.00012034, "retrieval_ms": 212.91780000046856, "generation_ms": 1857.959099999789, "total_ms": 2070.8769000002576, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_dadd709a1cc447f99ff45412fc06079c", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D004", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "Your access request is fulfilled within 2 working days of final approval.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["OPS-104:v2.2:s2:c1"], "cited_text": {"OPS-104:v2.2:s2:c1": "Request access through the service portal using the \"System access\" form. Requests are fulfilled within 2 working days of the final approval. Do not share your login with a colleague who is waiting for access."}, "cited_by_model": ["OPS-104:v2.2:s2:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "OPS-104:v2.2:s2:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.03252247488101534, "sections": ["OPS-104#2"]}, {"id": "SUP-501:v1.0:s3:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.032018442622950824, "sections": ["SUP-501#3"]}, {"id": "OPS-104:v2.2:s3:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.03125763125763126, "sections": ["OPS-104#3"]}, {"id": "OPS-104:v2.2:s4:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.031009615384615385, "sections": ["OPS-104#4"]}, {"id": "OPS-104:v2.2:s6:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.03021353930031804, "sections": ["OPS-104#6"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 914, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 51, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 19, "cost_usd": 0.00011728000000000002, "retrieval_ms": 161.384399999406, "generation_ms": 1367.7356000007421, "total_ms": 1529.1200000001481, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_0ecf365e8b414cc68388bc3012a02488", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D005", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "If you mean vehicle telematics data from the lorries, it is kept for 2 years.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["SEC-302:v3.1:s2:c1"], "cited_text": {"SEC-302:v3.1:s2:c1": "| Record | Retention period |\n|---|---|\n| Delivery and proof-of-delivery records | 6 years from the delivery date |\n| Vehicle telematics data | 2 years |\n| CCTV footage from depots | 31 days, unless needed for an investigation |\n| IT incident and change tickets | 3 years from closure |\n| System access logs | 12 months |"}, "cited_by_model": ["SEC-302:v3.1:s2:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "SEC-302:v3.1:s2:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.03177805800756621, "sections": ["SEC-302#2"]}, {"id": "SEC-302:v3.1:s1:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.03131881575727918, "sections": ["SEC-302#1"]}, {"id": "SEC-302:v3.1:s3:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.0304147465437788, "sections": ["SEC-302#3"]}, {"id": "SEC-302:v3.1:s5:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.02964426877470356, "sections": ["SEC-302#5"]}, {"id": "SEC-302:v3.1:s4:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.029411764705882353, "sections": ["SEC-302#4"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 922, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 106, "reasoning_tokens": 47, "embedding_tokens": 13, "cost_usd": 0.00014545999999999998, "retrieval_ms": 165.53269999985787, "generation_ms": 2052.9238999997688, "total_ms": 2218.4565999996266, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_b593d0ef48494f4c9c3d3b722abe1388", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D006", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "Full-time staff receive 25 days of annual leave plus bank holidays each leave year, which runs from 1 April to 31 March.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["HR-204:v1.0:s1:c1"], "cited_text": {"HR-204:v1.0:s1:c1": "The leave year runs from 1 April to 31 March. Full-time staff receive 25 days of annual leave plus bank holidays. Part-time staff receive a pro-rata allowance."}, "cited_by_model": ["HR-204:v1.0:s1:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "HR-204:v1.0:s1:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.03278688524590164, "sections": ["HR-204#1"]}, {"id": "HR-201:v4.0:s4:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.029877369007803793, "sections": ["HR-201#4"]}, {"id": "HR-203:v1.3:s5:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.029827662395050816, "sections": ["HR-203#5"]}, {"id": "HR-204:v1.0:s3:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.029709507042253523, "sections": ["HR-204#3"]}, {"id": "OPS-103:v1.4:s5:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.028991596638655463, "sections": ["OPS-103#5"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 914, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 65, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 12, "cost_usd": 0.00012414000000000001, "retrieval_ms": 203.64909999989322, "generation_ms": 1677.0521999997072, "total_ms": 1880.7012999996005, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_2fbb65e1c5cc495aa78e77b7735a0a61", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D007", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "Company mobile phones are replaced every 3 years, or earlier if they fail.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["OPS-105:v1.1:s6:c1"], "cited_text": {"OPS-105:v1.1:s6:c1": "Laptops are replaced every 4 years and phones every 3 years, or earlier if they fail."}, "cited_by_model": ["OPS-105:v1.1:s6:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "OPS-105:v1.1:s6:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.03252247488101534, "sections": ["OPS-105#6"]}, {"id": "OPS-105:v1.1:s1:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.032266458495966696, "sections": ["OPS-105#1"]}, {"id": "HR-203:v1.3:s6:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.03200204813108039, "sections": ["HR-203#6"]}, {"id": "OPS-105:v1.1:s5:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.03125, "sections": ["OPS-105#5"]}, {"id": "OPS-105:v1.1:s2:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.029083245521601686, "sections": ["OPS-105#2"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 871, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 90, "reasoning_tokens": 35, "embedding_tokens": 8, "cost_usd": 0.00013226, "retrieval_ms": 179.46169999959238, "generation_ms": 2065.40060000043, "total_ms": 2244.8623000000225, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_1354912374b945aab7508fa33ecbe0bd", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D008", "status": "ok", "outcome": "insufficient_evidence", "answer": "The handbook does not specify how much notice is needed before a guest comes to site. The supplied access guidance covers contractors, not guest notice requirements.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["FAC-401:v2.0:s2:c1"], "cited_text": {"FAC-401:v2.0:s2:c1": "Contractors must complete the site safety induction before starting work. The induction is valid for 12 months at the site where it was completed. Contractors carrying out hot work, work at height or work on electrical systems need a permit to work issued by the site manager."}, "cited_by_model": ["FAC-401:v2.0:s2:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "HR-204:v1.0:s2:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.03252247488101534, "sections": ["HR-204#2"]}, {"id": "FAC-401:v2.0:s2:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.031054405392392875, "sections": ["FAC-401#2"]}, {"id": "OPS-104:v2.2:s5:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.030536130536130537, "sections": ["OPS-104#5"]}, {"id": "OPS-102:v2.0:s3:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.028790389395194696, "sections": ["OPS-102#3"]}, {"id": "FAC-401:v2.0:s5:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.02857142857142857, "sections": ["FAC-401#5"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 941, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 181, "reasoning_tokens": 110, "embedding_tokens": 15, "cost_usd": 0.00018490000000000002, "retrieval_ms": 176.96280000018305, "generation_ms": 3051.374499999838, "total_ms": 3228.337300000021, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_8ab779467ea246c5afed82b94ded56ee", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D009", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "Normal changes affecting depot systems are implemented between 22:00 and 04:00, unless CAB agrees a different window.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["OPS-102:v2.0:s7:c1"], "cited_text": {"OPS-102:v2.0:s7:c1": "Normal changes affecting depot systems are implemented between 22:00 and 04:00 unless CAB agrees a different window, because these are the quietest hours for picking and dispatch."}, "cited_by_model": ["OPS-102:v2.0:s7:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "OPS-102:v2.0:s7:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.03278688524590164, "sections": ["OPS-102#7"]}, {"id": "OPS-102:v2.0:s3:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.03225806451612903, "sections": ["OPS-102#3"]}, {"id": "OPS-102:v2.0:s6:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.03149801587301587, "sections": ["OPS-102#6"]}, {"id": "OPS-102:v2.0:s1:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.030798389007344232, "sections": ["OPS-102#1"]}, {"id": "OPS-102:v2.0:s5:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.030309988518943745, "sections": ["OPS-102#5"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 881, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 62, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 11, "cost_usd": 0.00011932, "retrieval_ms": 202.61369999934686, "generation_ms": 1139.162600000418, "total_ms": 1341.776299999765, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_ddfad27852fe4c79b952630107f8f661", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D010", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "Domestic flights are allowed only when the equivalent rail journey would take more than 5 hours each way. All flights must be economy class.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["HR-202:v2.0:s5:c1"], "cited_text": {"HR-202:v2.0:s5:c1": "Domestic flights are allowed only when the equivalent rail journey would take more than 5 hours each way. All flights are economy class."}, "cited_by_model": ["HR-202:v2.0:s5:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "HR-202:v2.0:s5:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.03278688524590164, "sections": ["HR-202#5"]}, {"id": "HR-202:v2.0:s3:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.031754032258064516, "sections": ["HR-202#3"]}, {"id": "HR-202:v2.0:s1:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.0315136476426799, "sections": ["HR-202#1"]}, {"id": "HR-202:v2.0:s2:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.031024531024531024, "sections": ["HR-202#2"]}, {"id": "HR-203:v1.3:s5:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.030330882352941176, "sections": ["HR-203#5"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 849, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 64, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 6, "cost_usd": 0.00011702000000000001, "retrieval_ms": 173.8999999997759, "generation_ms": 2017.0959000006405, "total_ms": 2190.9959000004164, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_c1770a563e2247199c53e8138e229ceb", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D011", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "Report it as a security incident within 1 hour of noticing. Staff who report promptly will not be disciplined for the mistake.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["SEC-303:v1.2:s4:c1", "SEC-303:v1.2:s5:c1"], "cited_text": {"SEC-303:v1.2:s4:c1": "If personal data or Confidential information is sent to the wrong person, report it as a security incident within 1 hour of noticing. The Information Security team decides whether the incident must be reported to the Information Commissioner's Office.", "SEC-303:v1.2:s5:c1": "Staff who report an incident promptly will not be disciplined for the mistake that caused it. Late reporting makes incidents much harder to contain."}, "cited_by_model": ["SEC-303:v1.2:s4:c1", "SEC-303:v1.2:s5:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "SEC-303:v1.2:s4:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.03278688524590164, "sections": ["SEC-303#4"]}, {"id": "SEC-303:v1.2:s1:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.0315136476426799, "sections": ["SEC-303#1"]}, {"id": "SEC-303:v1.2:s5:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.03057889822595705, "sections": ["SEC-303#5"]}, {"id": "SEC-303:v1.2:s2:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.03055037313432836, "sections": ["SEC-303#2"]}, {"id": "SUP-501:v1.0:s6:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.030158730158730156, "sections": ["SUP-501#6"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 907, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 74, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 22, "cost_usd": 0.00012814, "retrieval_ms": 164.88900000058493, "generation_ms": 1778.3996999996816, "total_ms": 1943.2887000002665, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_952059d0419942b9bc160658063942ac", "warnings": []}
{"id": "D012", "status": "ok", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "No. While on call, engineers must not drink alcohol.", "conflict_note": "", "citations": ["OPS-103:v1.4:s4:c1"], "cited_text": {"OPS-103:v1.4:s4:c1": "While on call, engineers must be able to reach a laptop and a reliable internet connection within 20 minutes, and must not drink alcohol."}, "cited_by_model": ["OPS-103:v1.4:s4:c1"], "removed_citations": [], "retrieved": [{"id": "OPS-103:v1.4:s4:c1", "rank": 1, "score": 0.03278688524590164, "sections": ["OPS-103#4"]}, {"id": "HR-201:v4.0:s5:c1", "rank": 2, "score": 0.03149801587301587, "sections": ["HR-201#5"]}, {"id": "OPS-103:v1.4:s5:c1", "rank": 3, "score": 0.031024531024531024, "sections": ["OPS-103#5"]}, {"id": "OPS-103:v1.4:s3:c1", "rank": 4, "score": 0.031009615384615385, "sections": ["OPS-103#3"]}, {"id": "OPS-103:v1.4:s6:c1", "rank": 5, "score": 0.03021353930031804, "sections": ["OPS-103#6"]}], "generation_skipped": false, "model": "gpt-6-luna", "input_tokens": 936, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 49, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "embedding_tokens": 10, "cost_usd": 0.00011830000000000002, "retrieval_ms": 169.95939999924303, "generation_ms": 1264.9399000001722, "total_ms": 1434.8992999994152, "provider_retries": 0, "provider_request_id": "req_cf82f1281044408c9a26c9f4cbb1622f", "warnings": []}
